  "_additionalGraphs": [
    {
      "id": "g_2",
      "name": "Screen Sample",
      "kind": "function",
      "color": null,
      "data": {
        "contract": {
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "crt_ss_uv",
              "name": "uv",
              "type": "vec2"
            }
          ],
          "outputs": [
            {
              "id": "crt_ss_color",
              "name": "color",
              "type": "vec3"
            }
          ]
        },
        "notes": "Reads the background at a position on the sprite (0..1). Every picture read in the CRT goes through here, so they all map to the screen the same way.\n\nThe remap starts from srcStart..srcEnd measured inside srcOriginStart..srcOriginEnd: the part of the sprite Construct is actually drawing. That is 0..1 normally, but when Construct pre-draws the sprite (3D layers, Must Predraw) and it is partly off screen, destStart..destEnd covers only the visible part, and a fixed 0..1 would squeeze the whole picture into it.\n\nNothing past the edge of the screen was ever drawn, and reading there repeats the edge column as streaks. Over Blend Distance, measured in from the screen edge, two things can happen, both complete exactly at the edge: Edge Relax slides the read back toward this pixel's own position, and Edge Black darkens the result. A read that still lands past the edge always takes the pixel's own position, so no setting brings the streaks back; with Edge Relax below 100% that shows as a seam at the edge, which Edge Black at 100% hides. With Edge Relax on, a Blend Distance shorter than how far the curve moves pixels near the edge folds the picture over itself."
      },
      "contractVersion": 1,
      "shaderSettings": {
        "name": "",
        "version": "0.0.0.0",
        "author": "",
        "website": "",
        "documentation": "",
        "description": "",
        "category": "color",
        "blendsBackground": false,
        "crossSampling": false,
        "preservesOpaqueness": true,
        "animated": false,
        "isDeprecated": false,
        "usesDepth": false,
        "mustPredraw": false,
        "supports3DDirectRendering": false,
        "extendBoxH": 0,
        "extendBoxV": 0,
        "floatPrecision": "lowp",
        "targetWebgl1": true,
        "targetWebgl2": true,
        "targetWebgpu": true
      },
      "camera": {
        "x": -785,
        "y": -200,
        "zoom": 1
      },
